OL,3,GNEWSAEA forces council to curb lake
OL,4,Aflood risk
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lake is failing safety standards and
OL,7,Frequires improvements worth more than
OL,8,F#1m to "reduce the risk of life" posed
OL,9,Fby a potential flood.
OL,11,FThe Environment Agency (EA) has served
OL,12,Fan enforcement notice to Gateshead
OL,13,FCouncil over the condition of the lake
OL,14,Fat Watergate Forest Park.
OL,16,FThe notice means the authority must
OL,17,Freduce the risk of the lake overflowing
OL,18,Fduring extreme rain by February in
OL,19,Forder to avoid being taken to court.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
